        </h1>

        @* Deliberately not "published" - it's Pending until an admin approves. *@
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
            Your review has been submitted and is awaiting moderation. Once it's checked,
            it'll appear on your provider's profile.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
            <a href="/my-request"
               class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center bg-jade-500 px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-cta rounded-card transition-colors hover:bg-jade-600">
                Back to my request
            </a>
            <a href="/my-request/review"
               class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center border border-ink-200 px-6 text-sm font-medium text-ink-800 bg-white rounded-card transition-colors hover:border-jade-500 hover:text-jade-600">
                View my review
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
